## InvoiceProcessing — Maestro Flow

**Status:** `flow validate` → **Valid** (0 errors, 0 warnings)

### Flow topology

```
New Invoice in SharePoint ──▶ Download Invoice File ──▶ Extract Invoice Fields ──▶ Build SAP Payload ──▶ Submit Invoice to ERP ──▶ Invoice Processed
                                      │                         │                        │                       │
                                      └─── error ──────────────┴───── error ────────────┴───── error ───────────┘
                                                                                                                  ▼
                                                                                                     Send Error Notification ──▶ Processing Failed
```

### What each node does

| Node | Type | Status |
|---|---|---|
| **New Invoice in SharePoint** | OneDrive/SharePoint polling trigger — fires when a file is created in "New Vendor" folder | Needs IT connection |
| **Download Invoice File** | Downloads the PDF using the file ID from the trigger output | Needs IT connection |
| **Extract Invoice Fields** | IxP extraction with the `InvoiceIXP` model (already wired to your tenant's model) | Ready — uses model `invoiceixp-cef0d447-ixp` in folder `Shared` |
| **Build SAP Payload** | Script node — extracts InvoiceNumber, VendorName, InvoiceDate, TotalAmount, line items from IxP output | Ready |
| **Submit Invoice to ERP** | Manual HTTP POST to `https://sap.ourcompany.com/api/invoices` | Ready — swap URL when IT confirms |
| **Send Error Notification** | Outlook 365 email alert on any failure | Needs IT connection |
| **Invoice Processed / Processing Failed** | End nodes | Ready |

